    >>> jnp.where(x > 4)
    (Array([5, 6, 7, 8, 9], dtype=int32),)
    >>> jnp.nonzero(x > 4)
    (Array([5, 6, 7, 8, 9], dtype=int32),)

    When ``x`` and ``y`` are provided, ``where`` selects between them based on
    the specified condition:

    >>> jnp.where(x > 4, x, 0)
    Array([0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9], dtype=int32)

